snippet.description:
Play Clean Break for free on Steam: https://store.steampowered.com/app/3828850/Clean_Break/

Explore a quiet house. Destroy any furniture that seems... off. This is just a bit of decluttering. Probably. 

Clean Break is a short first-person narrative game about objects, memory, and the quiet violence of letting go.

A surreal 20 minute journey through grief, memory, and emotional cleanup. 

Inspired by Perfect Vermin, developed by Talia bob Mair & Angad Matharoo.

